OL,3,GNEWSA'I can't find NHS psychologist job
OL,4,Aafter 10 years training'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who has spent almost ten years
OL,7,Ftraining with the NHS to becoming a
OL,8,Fclinical psychologist has said she will
OL,9,Fsoon be unemployed as there are "no
OL,10,Fjobs" for her in the organisation.
OL,12,FSoon-to-be qualified Grace Jackson, of
OL,13,FChorlton, Manchester, said she was
OL,14,Fbeing forced to consider moving to the
OL,15,Fprivate sector.
OL,17,FThe Unite union held a protest outside
OL,18,FNumber 10 North in Manchester on Friday
OL,19,Fover the lack of permanent roles for
OL,20,FNHS trained mental health workers and a
OL,21,Frise in temporary contracts.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
