OL,3,GNEWSA'I can't find NHS psychologist job
OL,4,Aafter 10 years training'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Department of Health and Social Care
OL,7,Fspokesperson said there had been a 15%
OL,8,Frise in the number of clinical
OL,9,Fpsychologists employed by the NHS over
OL,10,Fthe past five years.
